<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ATP WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HANOVER, Germany 1996-11-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifianl results in the</p>
<p>ATP Tour world tennis championship on Saturday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes world ranking):</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 4-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 6-7</p>
<p>(6-8) 7-6 (7-4) 7-5.</p>
<p>6-Boris Becker (Germany) beat 8-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-7 (4-7) 7-6 (7-3) 6-3</p>
</text>
